{
 "schema": "c8-d3-stage3a-test-seeds-1",
 "about": "HD6: the net seeds (and the two random.Random seeds) of the Stage-3a test runs with the real workers, per nc.net call site: expr is the call's seed argument as ast.unparse prints it (define: the value bound to a name argument), bindings the values the Stage-3a runs gave its names (the inventory has L <= 7), seeds the results. Base and native seeds were registered in round 3 (seeds_r3/). tests/unit_orchestration.py seeds_and_nets checks every call site is listed, every seed evaluates as listed, is in designs/forbidden_seeds.json and is refused as a plan seed. Stage 3b adds the L8 bindings of the existing call sites and the sites of tests/thread_identity.py and class_b.py part (f), registered before the Stage-3b runs; a seed may serve two call sites (9907: class_b (e) top-loop kernel at L7 and the d=3 payload check). Stage 4b adds G-L8SELF (tests/validate.py part_l8self, A-RPL-8) and tools/opt_speed.py (A-PERF-2, the same sample and net), which reuse two registered G-BK8 seeds by name: the draw random.Random(L8SELF_DRAW = 81113) and the 52-bit net of L8SELF_NET_SEED = 81121 (= 81113 + 8).",
